1
00:00:00,212 --> 00:00:03,462
(Leonard:)No, that doesn't sound right either.

2
00:00:04,133 --> 00:00:08,633
(Penny:)Tell her you need the relationship to move
at a pace you both are comfortable with.

3
00:00:09,888 --> 00:00:12,848
(Leonard:)Yeah, I could say something
like that to her.

4
00:00:13,350 --> 00:00:15,140
(Leonard:)I'll go do that.

5
00:00:15,602 --> 00:00:17,692
(Leonard:)- Thank you.
- Sure.

6
00:00:22,818 --> 00:00:25,238
(Leonard:)You have a really good grasp on this.

7
00:00:25,404 --> 00:00:27,404
(Leonard:)Maybe you could talk to her?

8
00:00:28,657 --> 00:00:30,157
(Penny:)You're kidding, right?

9
00:00:31,118 --> 00:00:33,038
(Leonard:)No, but that's okay.

10
00:00:35,664 --> 00:00:37,544
(Leonard:)I'll go talk to her.

11
00:00:39,543 --> 00:00:40,673
Wanna come with?

12
00:00:42,421 --> 00:00:44,421
(Steph:)Go.

13
00:00:46,258 --> 00:00:47,718
(Penny:)Wow.

14
00:00:55,934 --> 00:00:57,224
(Leonard:)Oh, no.

15
00:00:57,394 --> 00:00:59,434
(Penny:)What?

16
00:00:59,605 --> 00:01:02,565
(Steph:)You were right.
Your larynx is terribly inflamed.

